              <h2 style={{ fontSize: '2.25rem', fontWeight: 700, color: '#1e293b', marginBottom: '1rem' }}>
                About Our Center
              </h2>
              <p style={{ fontSize: '1.125rem', color: '#475569' }}>
                Pioneering research where intelligence meets connectivity.
              </p>
